        "language": "english",
        "review": "Please don't buy this game, I did it because it was on a sale and I didn't think it could be that bad for $5. It feels like the ai-slopiest of ai-slop. There's 0 depth. Every thing is just a static image that pulses and moves. There are maybe 4-5 'bosses' and 'areas' that recycle infinitely, with nothing stopping you from fighting the same 'boss' every time.\nBy my 3rd run I got to the max level. I have no idea how any other reviewer has 10+ hours in this 'game'. It became boring and repetitive after 5 minutes and I think I had seen all there was to see. I feel embarrassed to say that I played it for a whole 40 minutes, and even that it was running in a separate window while I watched youtube.\nI would feel disappointed if I paid $0.99 for it",
